{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Weapons|Wooden $Roundshield}}

Provides a bit of armor, and allows the player to use the Shield Up combat maneuver, this will make your defense 2.5 * your [[Skills#Melee_Combat|melee combat]] skill.

The defense buff works even if the shield is broken.

Softcapped by [[Dexterity]] and [[Carpentry]].

